  "body_html": "<h1>iia_strict</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem iia_strict [Fintype N] [Fintype A] {F : SWF N A} (hF : SWF.IIA F) {P Q : Profile N A} {a b : A} (hab : ∀ i, Prefers P i a b ↔ Prefers Q i a b) (hba : ∀ i, Prefers P i b a ↔ Prefers Q i b a) : strict (F P) a b ↔ strict (F Q) a b</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SWF</li>\n<li>IIA</li>\n<li>Profile</li>\n<li>Prefers</li>\n<li>BallotPrefers</li>\n<li>rank_injective</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n<li>rank_lt_iff</li>\n<li>rank_lt_card</li>\n<li>StrictlyPreferred.asymm</li>\n<li>BallotPrefers.asymm</li>\n<li>Prefers.asymm</li>\n<li>Unanimity</li>\n<li>IsWeaklyDecisiveFor</li>\n<li>IsDecisiveFor</li>\n<li>strict_transitive</li>\n<li>isWeaklyDecisiveFor_of_isDecisiveFor</li>\n</ul>",
